  "vector_memory": {
    "semantic_summary": "The TopBar component acts as the primary control panel for the editor interface, orchestrating core functionalities like scene playback, view switching (assets/code), and user session management. It consumes state from EditorStateService and communicates commands to EditorService based on user interactions. It manages authentication status via AuthService and displays user details retrieved from UserService, providing a centralized control hub for the editing experience."
  },
